### Login (save cookie in your API client)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"admin","password":"REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_PASSWORD"}

### Create branch (admin only)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/branches
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Lusaka Main Branch","location":"Lusaka"}

### Create a loan officer (replace branch ID)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"officer01","full_name":"Example Officer","password":"ChangeThisPassword123!","role":"loan_officer","branch_ids":[1]}

### Create a customer
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{"customer_code":"CUST-0001","full_name":"Example Customer","phone":"0970000000","address":"Lusaka","employer":"Example Employer","branch_id":1}

### Create a loan (all monetary fields in kwacha)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{"loan_code":"LN-0001","customer_id":1,"branch_id":1,"principal_kwacha":1000,"interest_kwacha":250,"fee_kwacha":50,"due_date":"2026-11-30"}

### Record a payment
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/loans/1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount_kwacha":100,"method":"mobile_money","reference":"TXN12345","note":"First instalment"}
